    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2728.svg"> Ngilahlekelwe okuningi muva nje <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127807;"
    title="herb"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f33f.svg"> 06/06/2025 - Bulgaria</strong>

...Futhi kulokho kulahlekelwa, ngazuza into engangingayilindele:
Ukucaca.

Umphakathi usifundisa ukuthi sizimboze ngezendlalelo — iziqu, izindima, ubuwena — sengathi ukuzivikela kusenza siqine.
Kodwa uNkulunkulu wangikhombisa iqiniso: lezo zendlalelo zazingenza ngihambe kancane.

Umhlaba uthi: “Zihlomise.”
Izulu lithi: “Khulula konke, ufinyelele emoyeni.”

Kule vidiyo, ngiyacabangisisa ngokuthi ukulahla amalebula, izindima, ngisho nobudlelwano, kungikhulule kanjani.
Lokho engangikubona njengobuthakathaka… kwaphenduka amandla ami amakhulu kakhulu.

Manje ngihamba ngikhululekile.
Ngihamba ngokushesha.
Ngihamba noNkulunkulu.

#SpiritualAwakening #LetGoToGrow #GodsStrength #IdentityInChrist #SoulFreedom #LiveUnburdened

