Ngahlangabezana nemikhawulo engekho emthethweni ekufinyeleleni ezimalini zami — ngaphandle kwenqubo efanele, ukucaca, noma ikhambi.

Lokhu kwakungagcini nje ngesikhungo esisodwa, igunya elilodwa, noma umngcele owodwa.
Kwembula isandla esihlelelekile esisebenza ngaphezu kwemingcele yezizwe, singanaki ubukhosi noma imikhawulo yomthetho.

Ukuthembela kuphela ezinhlelweni ezimaphakathi kudala iphuzu elilodwa lokwehluleka.
Ukuzigcinela wena uqobo kanye nokugcina okungaxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi kuyizenzo ezisemthethweni zokuzinza nokumelana.

Ukwehlukanisa amandla akusikho ukuvukela.
Kuwukuzivikela.

#FinancialSovereignty #SelfCustody #RuleOfLaw #Decentralization #Resilience #StaySovereign

