Cabanga uvuka emhlabeni ongenakho ukukhumbula isikweletu, inzuzo noma impi.
Lapho yonke imikhakha ikwazi ukukhumbula “manje” kuphela.
Mhlawumbe ukuthula akuyona into esiyilwelayo —
mhlawumbe yilokho okusala lapho ekugcineni sikhohlwa izolo.

