Lo msebenzi uyaphela.
Futhi lapho uphela, ukuthula kufika ngokwemvelo.
Lena yiyo umehluko phakathi komsebenzi othembekile
nezinhlelo ezidla umzamo ngaphandle kokuqedwa —
lapho ukwenyuka kwamanani (inflation) kuguqula umsebenzi ube umthombo ongenamkhawulo
futhi ukuthula kuhlehliswa unomphela.

