    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2728.svg"> Injabulo Ibuyela Ngomzuzu Osukuma Ube Nesibindi Sokugxuma 01/12/2025 - i-Georgia</strong>

Izinyembezi zakho azisho ukuphuka —
zisho ukuhlanzeka.

Lapho udedela umthwalo owawungakaze wenzelwe ukuwuthwala,
udala isikhala senjabulo ezinzile —
uhlobo lomhlaba ongakwazi ukulunyakazisa,
ngoba luyagxila eqinisweni elithulile elingaphakathi kuwe.

Dedela.
Hambela phambili.
Themba inqubo yokuba.
Injabulo ikuhlangabeza ngesikhathi ugxuma.

#uhlakaniphobezinkondlo #uhambo_lwangaphakathi #umoya_uyakhuluma #indlela_yokuvuka #ukucaca_kwezemizwa #ukuzithola #iqiniso_langaphakathi #umqondo_wokukhula #ubukhona #umlingo_wanamuhla

