    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f49a.svg"> Sika Ngokwazi — Hhayi Ngokukhohlwa 13/11/2025 - T&#252;rkiye</strong>

Sonke siyasika nsuku zonke.
Wonke umcabango okhishwayo.
Yonke inkolelo ededelwa.
Yonke imikhuba esesiyidlulile.
Kanjalo kwakheka ingadi yangaphakathi.

Ukusika akusikho ukufa kwe-ego.
Kuyisahlukaniso —
ukususa lokho okwangezwa ngokwesaba, ukuqeqeshwa, kanye nefa,
ukuze okungokoqobo kuphinde kuphefumule.

UJesu wathi uMbuso ungowabantwana —
eqinisa inhloso yokudedela ukuqeqeshwa
okwakungekho kwakho kusukela ekuqaleni.

Esidlweni Sokugcina, uJesu wathi:
“Lena ingumzimba wami, onikelwe ngenxa yenu.”
Lokhu kwakungesona isiyalo sokuphindaphinda ngokungaboni,
kodwa kwakuyisimemo sokukhumbula —
ukuze incazelo yale ndlela yokuba khona inganyamalali.

Ukukhumbula ngaphandle kobukhona akusikho ukukhumbula neze.
Isiko eliphindaphindwa ngaphandle kokuqaphela alilihloniphi umhlatshelo —
liwukhohlwa.

Lapho sisika ngokwazi,
sivikela ingxenye ebaluleke kakhulu kithi…
<img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127800;"
    title="cherry_blossom"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f338.svg"> ingane yangaphakathi —
hhayi engenalwazi,
kodwa evukile.

Nakekela ingadi yakho ngokwazi.
Ukuphinda umjikelezo ngaphandle kokuqonda
kumane kuvimbele ukukhula kwakho.

