<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1469975923226050650 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1469975923226050650><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, February 8, 2026 3:39 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1469975923226050650>2/8/2026 3:39 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="✝️"
    title="cross"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/271d.svg"> Inkululeko KuKristu 21/09/2025 - Albania</strong>

Wonke amaketango okwesaba.
Wonke amanga.
Wonke amasistimu okulawula.

Aphukile — egameni likaJesu Kristu, iNdodana kaNkulunkulu ophilayo.
Ngegazi Lakhe sikhululiwe.
Ngomphambano Wakhe sahlengwa.
Ngokuvuka Kwakhe sesingathinteki.

Alikho izwe lombuso, akukho mbusi, futhi akukho mandla
ake ame ngokumelene nosindiso lukaKristu —
futhi ngeke kube khona.

“Uma iNdodana ikunikeza inkululeko,
uyoba ukhululekile ngempela.”
— Johane 8:36

Ngikhuluma inkululeko manje —
kimi uqobo.
ezinganeni zami.
nakubo bonke abazwayo lokhu.

