“Akusona isibhamu esibulalayo — kodwa isinqumo esidluliselwa kwabanye.”
Lokhu kubuka izinto kuchaza impi yokomoya engemuva kwenkulumo-ze yezepolitiki.
Njengoba kusikhumbuza abase-Efesu 6:11–12:

Gqokani izikhali zonke zikaNkulunkulu...

Imibhikisho enokuthula iyaqhubeka.
Kodwa yini efihlekile ngaphansi kwalemithetho?
Ikhonza bani ngempela — futhi yimaphi amandla angabonakali aqondisa izinqumo zethu?

