<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1470124440040902930 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1470124440040902930><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, February 8, 2026 1:29 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1470124440040902930>2/8/2026 1:29 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127788;️"
    title="wind_blowing_face"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f32c.svg"> Ukuqondiswa Kabusha 27/12/2025 - i-Georgia</strong>

Bengifuna ukubheka nje futhi ngibe sobala.

Isibuyekezo: Kule vidiyo ngikhuluma ngokuthi ngenze i-akhawunti entsha ye-Instagram. Ngeshwa, selokhu ngayiqopha, nayo leyo akhawunti nayo isivaliwe. Manje sengidale ama-akhawunti amathathu ahlukene e-Instagram, ngalinye lixhunywe ku-imeyili ehlukile — futhi wonke avaliwe noma akhutshaziwe.

Njalo ngitshelwa ukuthi ngiphule imigomo nemibandela yeplathifomu.
Kodwa i-akhawunti yami yakamuva yayinevidiyo eyodwa kuphela efakiwe ngaphambi kokuthi ivalwe.

Angizukwenza sengathi akungishiyanga ngizizwa ngidangele kancane — hhayi ngenxa ye-ego noma izinombolo, kodwa ngoba okuqukethwe engabelana ngakho kwakhiwa yilokho engikuboniswa kule plathifomu — futhi kwesinye isikhathi engikubonayo kuzizwa njengomgudu.

Inhloso yami ibihlale iwukusiza ukukhomba indlela yokuphuma.

Ngakho-ke uma into enje iqhubeka yenzeka, kushiya indawo encane kakhulu yokucabanga ukuthi kungani.

#CheckIn #Redirection #Clarity #CreatorJourney #StillMoving #AdaptAndGrow #Gratitude #Perspective #Resilience

