Basitshela ukuthi ukuthula yinto okufanele uyizuze,
into ethunyelwa emadolobheni, ezinhlelweni, nasekusayineneni. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127961;️"
    title="cityscape"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3d9.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128395;️"
    title="pen_fountain"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f58b.svg">
Kodwa phakathi kwezindonga ezincipha nezindleko ezikhuphukayo,
ukulawula kwanyamalala buthule.

Iveni ifundisa isigqi esihlukile.
Ukuthula okugcinwa ngezandla zakho uqobo.
Isikhala esikhula ngoba singesakho. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127807;"
    title="herb"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f33f.svg">

Azikho izindlela zokuziduduza.
Akukho ukuthula okwenziwa amakhemikhali.
Akudingeki imvume.

Kukhona kuphela amandla athule okukhetha lapho uphumula khona,
lapho uhamba khona,
nokuthi yini oyivikelayo. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128273;"
    title="key"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f511.svg">

Lokhu akusikho ukubaleka — kungukubuyisa.
Akukhona ukugijima emhlabeni,
kodwa ukubuyela emandleni akho.

Yiba nesikhala sakho.
Yiba nesigqi sakho.
Yiba nokuthula kwakho. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127748;"
    title="sunrise_over_mountains"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f304.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg">

