<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1478715156656820296 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1478715156656820296><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Wednesday, March 4, 2026 6:26 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1478715156656820296>3/4/2026 6:26 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Beka Phansi Inkemba — Makubuse Ukuthula <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="✝️"
    title="cross"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/271d.svg"> 17/11/2025 - T&#252;rkiye</strong>

Balwa nempi ngokumelene nokuthula sengathi ukuthula kuwumbuso oyimbangi — kodwa ukuthula kweqiniso akulwi. Kumane kuhlale kunjalo.
UKristu akazange asicele ukuba sizisule noma sizicime. Wasicelela ukuba sikhumbule ukuthi singobani Kuye: siphelele, singesabi, futhi sikhululekile.
Beka phansi inkemba. Makubuse ukuthula.
Ekuzithobeni eqinisweni, impi iyaphela — futhi kusala kuphela okungokoqobo. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128156;"
    title="purple_heart"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f49c.svg"><img
