<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1479793548055412850 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1479793548055412850><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Saturday, March 7, 2026 5:51 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1479793548055412850>3/7/2026 5:51 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>I-Karma Ye-Gaslighting — Angivumi <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128293;"
    title="fire"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f525.svg"> 04/03/2026 - i-Georgia</strong>

Ake ngikucacise lokhu.

Uma umuntu enza umonakalo ngamabomu futhi enenhloso — bese ezama ukudlulisela imiphumela ye-karma komunye umuntu — lokho akusona i-karma. Lokho ukuhlukumeza.

Ngakhuluma. Ngaxwayisa abantu. Ngahlinzeka ubufakazi. Lapho sekungaphephile, ngahoxa. Ukuthuliswa noma i-gaslighting akusho ukuthi umuntu uyavuma.

Futhi ngifuna lokhu kushiwo ngokucacile: Angivumi kunoma yiluphi uhlelo olucatshangelwayo lokuzalwa kabusha (reincarnation loop) oluhloselwe ukucubungula i-karma yomunye umuntu ngenxa yezono ezenziwe ngamabomu. Akekho okufanele aphoqwe ukuthwala imiphumela yezono angazenzanga.

I-karma ingeyomuntu oyidalayo. Iqiniso lihlala libuyela emthonjeni walo. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg">

