<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1484288775260471387 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1484288775260471387><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, March 19, 2026 4:33 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1484288775260471387>3/19/2026 4:33 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Ubufakazi Bokuzithanda Ngokweqile UbuyiSistimu <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129504;"
    title="brain"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f9e0.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128293;"
    title="fire"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f525.svg"> 28/01/2026 - i-Georgia
(Ingqikithi Enwetshiwe — Ihlanganisa Imizuzu Engu-20 Yezithombe Ezengeziwe)</strong>

Lokhu akusona nje indaba yomuntu siqu — kumayelana nokuthi ukuzithanda ngokweqile kusebenza kanjani ngezinga elibanzi.

Ukuzithanda ngokweqile kuphila ngokulawula, ukudideka, ukuncika kanye nokukhathala. Uma izinhlelo zilahlekelwa ukubophezeleka, ziqala ukubonisa izimpawu ezifanayo: i-gaslighting (ukudlala ngengqondo), ukususa icala, ukuthulisa abantu, kanye nokujezisa ukuzimela.

Ngesikhathi sokuhlukana kwami, ngabona ukuthi izinqubo zomthetho, ingcindezi yezimali kanye nezindaba zezempilo yengqondo zingasetshenziswa kabi ukususa amandla okuzilawula kubantu futhi zibabambe ngaphakathi komjikelezo okhulayo — umjikelezo oqeda amandla, ubuwena kanye nethemba.

Ngikwabelana lokhu hhayi ngenxa yentukuthelo, kodwa ngenxa yokucaca. Lapho ukuzithanda ngokweqile kuba kwesakhiwo, akusabukeki njengomuntu — kubukeka njengezinqubomgomo, izinqubo, kanye “nendlela izinto ezisebenza ngayo”.

Uma uke wenziwa ukuthi ungabaze iqiniso lakho, wajeziswa ngokukhuluma iqiniso, noma waphoqwa ukuba uphile kuphela esikhundleni sokuphola — awuphukile. Usabela ohlelweni olwakhiwe ngaphandle kozwelo.

Ukuqwashisa kuphula lo mjikelezo.

