<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1490265141168574534 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1490265141168574534><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, April 5, 2026 4:21 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1490265141168574534>4/5/2026 4:21 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Ikheji Akulona Ikhaya Lakho <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127749;"
    title="sunrise"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f305.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129718;"
    title="feather"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1fab6.svg"> 06/04/2025 - Thailand</strong>

Ngizwile le ngoma ngesikhathi ngihamba emakethe eJapane, usuku olujwayelekile nje... futhi yangivimba.

“Vumela indawo yokukhula... ikheji akulona ikhaya lakho.”

Bengingabheki ngisho nophawu, kodwa uNkulunkulu wabeka olunye phambi kwami.

“I-Sparrow” ka-The Hunts yadlala, futhi amagama ashaya kakhulu - njengeZulu lihleba ngomsindo womhlaba.

Futhi yize lowo mzuzu wenzeka eJapane, le vidiyo yaqoshwa eMhumeni iPraya Nakhon — ePrachuap Khiri Khan Thailand — endaweni lapho incazelo yomyalezo yavela khona ngempela

Yangikhumbuza ukuthi uNkulunkulu uvame ukusihola ngale ndlela - siphume ekuboshweni, ngenxa yokwesaba, siphume ezindaweni ezincane esisinde kuzo...

Futhi singene kokuthile okubanzi.

Isinkwa esingenalutho kwelinye izwe.

Impumelelo kwelinye.

Sakha amakheji ngenduduzo, ubuntu obudala, amaphethini okusinda… kodwa sasingakaze sidalelwe ukuhlala sigcinwe.

Ikheji akuyona ikhaya lakho.

Yenza indawo yokukhula.
Yelula amaphiko akho.

Themba indlela.

Ingoma ethi “Sparrow” kaThe Hunts — ingoma yeqembu le-indie folk duo iThe Hunts, efakwe ku-albhamu yabo ethi Hibernating Heart. Amagama angezansi kaTikTok.

#Ukuzingela #Indlunkulu #Indlunkulu yaseThailand #I-PrachuapKhiriKhan #Izimpawu Zaphezulu #Ukuhamba Kokholo #Uhambo Olungokomoya #Ukukhululeka #Ubuhlose Ukundiza #Indlela Yokwelapha #UNkulunkulu Uyakhuluma #Umphefumulo Ovukile

