Njenganoma yisiphi isiphonso, amandla aso ancike ekukholweni kwakho — ukubamba kwakho iqhaza.
Idola alithathi hlangothi, kanjalo nobukhapitali — ngabantwana bakaNkulunkulu ababehloselwe ukukhuphuka njalo.

Kodwa besilokhu sijwayela ukucabanga ukuthi idola lingaphezu kwethu,
futhi leyo nkolelo iwisa insimu yethu yamathuba ibe yisimo esincane.

Ukukhohlisa ukucabanga ukuthi silingana nezinhlelo esizidalile.

Baningi kakhulu abalwa ngaphakathi komjikelezo, bengaziboni amandla abanawo ngokumane baphume kuwo ngokuphelele.

