Sawubona, nginguStephen.</strong>

Ngemuva kokulayisha amadokhumenti aceliwe ukuze kususwe imikhawulo ku-akhawunti yami ye-Revolut, isinqumo sibuye senqatshwa — naphezu kokuthobela imithetho ngokugcwele. Imikhawulo isalokhu ikhona.

Kuleli qophelo, ngibhale phansi konke obala, futhi lapho ngicabanga, kukhona okujulile okwenzekayo lapha — futhi angivumelani nakho.

Manje ngicindezelwa ukuba ngicabange ngento engingakaze ngicabange ukuthi ngingayenza: ukufuna indawo yokuphephela ngaphandle kwe-Commonwealth.

Lokhu akukhona okuqukethwe — kuyiqiniso eliphilayo.

