<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1496779857143791676 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1496779857143791676><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Thursday, April 23, 2026 3:48 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1496779857143791676>4/23/2026 3:48 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Ukuba Ngumalusi Omuhle…” ≠ ukushushumbisa abantu <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="♻️"
    title="recycle"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/267b.svg"> 18/11/2025 – i-Georgia</strong>

Umalusi uvikela ukuzimela — akalokothi akuthathe indawo. Umshushumbisi uzuza ngokulahlekelwa yiko.

Futhi ngezinye izikhathi lokho okubukeka njengokunakekela… kuwukucubungula nje.

“Ungabulali.” — Eksodusi 20:13

Akuyona nje umzimba — kodwa nomoya, intando, ukuzimela ngaphakathi.

Lapho kukhona ukuphoqelelwa, ukuncika, noma ukulawula, kukhona okungahambi kahle kakade.

Ukunakekela akudli. Isiqondiso asisusi.

Futhi angikho lapha ukuze ngihlukaniswe ngibe yinto elula kakhulu.

Ukuqonda ukukhumbula umehluko.

