Selokhu ngabuya empini yomhlaba wonke, ngibone okuthile ngokusobala: abantu bayingcebo yangempela. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128161;"
    title="bulb"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4a1.svg">
Kodwa sibuka ukwesaba, izindleko ezikhuphukayo, kanye nemikhawulo &quot;kuqukethe&quot; futhi kuyihambisa leyo ngcebo.

Uma ukuthula, ukuphepha, kanye nokuvikeleka kuqala ekhaya <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127969;"
    title="house_with_garden"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3e1.svg">—ngeyunithi yomndeni—kungani abaningi kangaka bekhuthazwa ukukufuna kwenye indawo ngezithembiso, imiholo, noma imivuzo ebambezelekile?

Kukhona ukuphikisana lapha.

Sithi abantu babaluleke kakhulu… kodwa izinhlelo zisabasakaza ekulimaleni.

Mhlawumbe sekuyisikhathi sokuqaphela lokho esiyikho kakade—futhi sikuvikele. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
