    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127926;"
    title="notes"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3b6.svg"> 09/03/2026 - i-Georgia</strong>

Amandla obudoda nabesifazane adlala indima ebalulekile endleleni esiphila ngayo kanye nobudlelwano. Sekuyiminyaka eminingi, la mandla ehlelwe ngokwesiko abe yizindima ezibikezelwayo, ngokuvamile ngokusekelwe ekubukekeni kwangaphandle. Kodwa isintu sishintshile. Umbuzo manje ukuthi siyaqhubeka yini nokuphindaphinda amaphethini amadala—noma siphinde sithole ibhalansi ngobuqiniso kanye nokuqwashisa.

