<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1515254708116132001 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1515254708116132001><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Saturday, June 13, 2026 3:21 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1515254708116132001>6/13/2026 3:21 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Ezombusazwe ZiyiTheatre 30/09/2025 - Albania</strong>

Ezombusazwe zihlelwe njengempikiswano - kodwa ingxoxo iyibhokisi lesihlabathi nje, isigaba lapho ingxabano yenziwa khona ngenkathi iqiniso lishiywa ngaphandle. Ligcina abantu bejabule, belele, futhi behlukene ngenkathi libiza ngokuthi ukuthula. Ngisho namanga anendawo yawo, enikeza labo abanokudlidliza okuphansi isikhala sokubonakala. Kodwa intuthuko yangempela ayimayelana nokunqoba izimpikiswano ngaphakathi kwalelo bhokisi lesihlabathi. Imayelana nokungena ekuhambisaneni - lapho iqiniso lilinganisa khona, ukuthula kungokoqobo, futhi izisekelo zinganyakaziswa. Ukuhambisana kuyindlu yesibane. Futhi izindlu zesibane aziphikisani ngesiphepho - zikhanya ngazo.

#ezombusazwe #impikiswano #ishashalazi #ukuvuka #iqiniso #ukuhambisana #ukuqonda okuphezulu #ukuvuka ngokomoya #i-matrix #indlu yesibane #ukuvuka #ukuthula #uthando #ukuqonda #i-truthseeker

