<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1515674784082427936 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1515674784082427936><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Sunday, June 14, 2026 7:10 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1515674784082427936>6/14/2026 7:10 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Ukukhathala Kobubele Akusikho Unya - Kuyisibonakaliso Sesimiso Esiphukile 22/12/2025 - Georgia</strong>

Le mpikiswano ikhona ngoba abantu bayakhathalela - bamane basabela ebuhlungwini obufanayo ngezindlela ezahlukene.

Abanye basabela ngosizi nokuphuthuma; abanye ngokukhathala nokukhathala kobubele. Bobabili bangabantu.

Inkinga akuyona uzwela - kuyisimiso esisakaza ukuhlupheka ngaphandle kokuxazulula izimbangela zaso.

Isisa kufanele silondoloze isithunzi futhi siholele ekukhululweni, hhayi ukuncika isikhathi eside noma ukuhlukana.

Umgomo ulula: ukuzinza, isithunzi, kanye nomhlaba lapho ukusiza kungasadingi ubuhlungu bokusakaza.

