<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1526651408697524315 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1526651408697524315><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Tuesday, July 14, 2026 2:07 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1526651408697524315>7/14/2026 2:07 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Ukushiya Konke Ngemuva <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127890;"
    title="school_satchel"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f392.svg"> 04/07/2026 - eJalimane <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127465;&#127466;"
    title="flag_de"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f1e9-1f1ea.svg"></strong>

Namuhla ngifinyelele ezimpambanweni ezinkulu zemigwaqo.

Ngemva kokubuyela eJalimane, ngipake iveni yami yekamu eduze kwesikhumulo sezindiza iFrankfurt njengoba isikhathi sayo sokubhalisa kanye nomshuwalense siphela. Njengoba sengivele ngixhumane neCarTurf mayelana nemoto kanye nokuthengiswa kwayo okuhlosiwe, ngibhale phansi ukuthi ishiywe kuphi ngaphambi kokugibela indiza eya esikhathini esizayo esingaqinisekile.

Lokhu bekungekona nje ukushiya imoto—bekumayelana nokuyeka isahluko sempilo esasinesisindo esikhulu sezezimali, sezomthetho, nesomuntu siqu. Iveni yanikeza ukuzinza phakathi nesinye sezikhathi ezinzima kakhulu zohambo lwami, kodwa izimo seziqede leso sahluko.

Ngezimali ezilinganiselwe, kungekho ndawo yokuhlala unomphela, kanye nezinto eziningi ezingaziwa ezizayo, le vidiyo isebenza njengerekhodi lokuthi izinto zimi kuphi namuhla. Ngezinye izikhathi impilo idinga ukukhulula lokho okwakhile nokuqhubeka phambili ngaphandle kwethemba, ukuqina, kanye nokholo lokuthi isahluko esilandelayo sizoziveza ngesikhathi.

Noma ngabe le ndlela iholela kuphi, lo mzuzu manje uyingxenye yohambo.

Ngiyabonga ngokulandelana.

⁠iJalimane #iFrankfurt #iCamperVan #iVanLife #Isibuyekezo Sempilo #Ukuqala Okusha #Ukuqala Kabusha #Ukholo #Ukuqina #Ukuhamba #Idokhumenti #Uhambo Lomuntu Siqu #Ubuncane #Ukuvumela Ukuhamba #Ukuguquka #I-Adventure #Ithemba #Uhambo Lwempilo #Amandla Elanga #I-CarTurf

