<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1526973480476737676 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1526973480476737676><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Wednesday, July 15, 2026 11:27 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1526973480476737676>7/15/2026 11:27 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Usuku Lokubuya Komoya Wami <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128148;"
    title="broken_heart"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f494.svg"> 18/06/2026 - Georgia</strong>

Ngesikhathi ngishumayela ngoMoya oNgcwele owehlayo, ngabhekana nento engingayazi kahle kangangokuthi yacishe yangiwisa. Okwalandela kwakungewona ukuthula ngomqondo ojwayelekile. Kwakuyimizwa. Ukwesaba. Ukudabuka okujulile. Ukudideka. Ukukhukhuleka kokuqaphela kanye nalokho engakubona njengolwazi olubuya ngasikhathi sinye.

Ngaqonda lokho okuhlangenwe nakho njengokubuya komoya wami.

Abanye bangase bahumushe okwalandela ngendlela ehlukile kakhulu. Abanye bangase bakubize ngokuthi ukuvuka ngokomoya. Abanye bangase bakubize ngokuthi ukuphazamiseka kwengqondo noma ukuwohloka. Abanye bangase bezwe izimpawu zenkolo, ukuhlukumezeka, usizi, noma isambulo.

Ngiyazi kuphela ukuthi kwakuzwakala kanjani ngaphakathi kwalokho okuhlangenwe nakho.

Kulobu bufakazi, ngikhuluma ngokukhululekile ngezinkolelo nokwesaba okwavela: ubuhlobo bami neSonto nombuso, umuzwa wokuthi umoya wami wawuhlukanisiwe nami, ukwesaba kwami ​​ukuxhashazwa, ukwenqaba kwami ​​ukuzibulala, kanye nokuqiniseka kwami ​​​​okukhula kokuthi kwakudingeka ngizisuse kunokuvumela ubuhlungu bami busabalale kwabanye.

Ngiphinde ngibhekane nobuhlobo bami noKristu—hhayi umbhalo ocwebezelayo nozisulayo engangiwufundisiwe, kodwa umbuzo wokuthi kusho ukuthini ukukhumbula ukuthi ungubani ngaphandle kokuzithulula kuze kube yilapho kungasali lutho.

Ngaphambi kokuphonsa amatshe, qonda lokhu:

Lapho umhlaba wami uhlukana, ngathatha enganginakho ngazisusa. Ngazama ukungaphuphi muntu—ngokomzimba, ngokwengqondo, noma ngokomphakathi. Ngahamba ngoba ngangifuna ukusabalala kobuhlungu kuphele kimi.

Le vidiyo ayilungile. Ezinye zeziphetho engizichazayo ziyamangalisa futhi ziyimfihlo kakhulu. Ngiyazabelana ngazo njengobufakazi bami nanjengomlando wesimo sami sengqondo, incazelo engokomoya, kanye nokuhlangenwe nakho engikuphile ngaleso sikhathi.

Hhayi ukufuna ukukholwa.

Hhayi ukuqasha abalandeli.

Hhayi ukuzinikela ekubeni ngumnikazi wolwazi lwami.

Okungibuyisele kimi kunamandla.

Hhayi ukuthengwa.

Hhayi ukudluliselwa.

Hhayi ukuthengiswa.

Lobu ubufakazi bami.

