    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f1ec-1f1ea.svg"></strong>

Muva nje bengilokhu ngicabanga ngomqondo oqhubeka nokuvela.

Kuthiwani uma izinhlelo eziningi zezinkolelo esinazo, ngandlela thile, ziyizinhlelo? Amaphethini esiwazuze njengefa, sawamukela, noma sawaphinda ngaphandle kokuma ukubuza ukuthi asasisebenzela yini.

Kuthiwani uma impilo ingeyona nje indaba <em>yokukhetha eyakho i-adventure</em>... kodwa indaba <strong>yokukhetha ukudlidliza kwakho</strong>—?

Njengoba bengilulama ngokomzimba futhi ngicabanga ngokuhlangenwe nakho kwami, ngizithole ngibona lezi zinhlelo ngokucacile. Ezinye zibonakala zisiqondisa esihawini, ekuhlakanipheni, nasenkululekweni. Ezinye zibonakala zisidonsela ekwesabeni, ekwahlukaneni, noma ekudidekeni. Inselele akukhona ukugwema zonke izinhlelo—kukufunda ukubona ukuthi yiziphi ezifanele ukunakwa kwethu.

Lokho kwenze ukuqonda kubaluleke kakhulu kunanini ngaphambili kimi. Esikhundleni sokwamukela yonke indaba ngokubukeka kwayo, ngifunda ukuma, ukubuka, ukubuza, nokuhlala ngigxile ebuhlotsheni bami noNkulunkulu noMoya oNgcwele.

Ukuphulukisa akuvamile ukuba yinto exakile. Ngezinye izikhathi kutholakala ngezikhathi zokuthula zokululama, ukuzindla, kanye nokubona iqiniso kancane kancane ngokucaca okukhulu.

Ngiyabonga kubo bonke abahamba kulolu hambo eceleni kwami. Nomaphi lapho indlela yakho iholela khona, ngithemba ukuthi nizoqhubeka nokufuna iqiniso ngokuthobeka, ukuqonda, kanye nokuthula.

Uthando olukhulu. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128156;"
    title="purple_heart"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f49c.svg">

