Awuwuvimbeli umlilo wasendle ngokuxosha ilangabi ngalinye.
Uyawuvimbeli ngokunakekela lowo omi kuwo.

Lokhu kumayelana nokuziphendulela, hhayi ukusola.
Mayelana nokukhula, hhayi ukulawula.
Mayelana nokubhekana nomlilo wakho ukuze ungachithekeli kwabanye.

Umsebenzi wangaphakathi ngumsebenzi othule —
kodwa ngumsebenzi oshintsha yonke into.

