Ngezinye izikhathi ukusabela okunamandla ngokomzwelo akuveli ezindabeni ngokwazo—kodwa ezinkolelweni, ubunikazi, kanye nezinhlelo esizibophezele kuzo ngokungazi.

Kuthiwani uma ukungakhululeki kungeyona into okufanele siyigweme ngaso sonke isikhathi, kodwa kuyisimemo sokubuza:

Ubani—noma yini—obumba imicabango yami, izindinganiso, kanye nomuzwa wami?

Ilukuluku linendlela yokwembula izinto ukuqiniseka okungenakukwazi.

