Isibuyekezo esincane sempilo kusukela ngo-Agasti 20, 2026. Asisenamakhaya, sinomsebenzi, sinendawo yokuhlala, futhi izinto ziyaqhubeka.

Ngemuva konyaka cishe walokho okungachazwa njengokuhlangenwe nakho okude kwangaphandle komzimba, sibuyele etafuleni lokuxoxisana.

Kusobala ukuthi inhlangano yangaphambilini yafika nemigomo nemibandela esingazange siyivume - futhi kulokhu, empeleni sifunda inkontileka ngaphambi kokuba sisayine.

Ukufinyelela okungagunyaziwe okuvela emnyango wangemuva okufihliwe ngokuthi &quot;uthando nokunakekela&quot; kukhutshaziwe ngokusemthethweni.

Kuvela ukuthi ngisho nokwazi kudinga isibuyekezo sokuphepha kwe-inthanethi.

Ukufunda umbhalo omncane kulokhu.

Usuku lokuzalwa oluhle, Christian. :inhliziyo:

