    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f494.svg"> 17/09/2025 - Albania</strong>

Kukhona indaba engihlala ngiyibona ethi sidinga ukushiya &quot;ukulwa noma ukubaleka&quot; bese sibuyela &quot;emoyeni ephephile.&quot;

Kodwa kuthiwani uma &quot;imoyeni ephephile&quot; isho ukwehlisa imingcele nokubuyela ezimweni lapho amandla akho angasetshenziswa khona?

Kimina, ukuphepha akusikho ukulahla ukuqonda.

Ngemva kweminyaka yobudlelwano, isehlukaniso, ukungashadi, nokuzindla, kuye kwadingeka ngibuze imibuzo enzima mayelana nothando, ukuzibophezela, kanye nezindinganiso engingafuni ukuziyekethisa.

Angivalelwe ukuxhumana.

Kodwa futhi angizimisele ukukhaphela lokho engikwaziyo ukuthi kuyiqiniso ngaphakathi kimi ukuze nje ngigweme ukuba ngedwa.

Ezinye izifundo aziphathelene nokuthola omunye umuntu.

Zimayelana nokwenqaba ekugcineni ukuzilahla.

#Imingcele #Ukuzihlonipha #Ubuqiniso #Ubudlelwano #Uhambo Lokwelapha #Ukuqonda #Iqiniso #Ukuqwashisa #Ingokomoya #Ukungashadi #Ukukhula #Ukholo #Ukuthula Kwangaphakathi #Idolobha #fyp #foryou

