<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1540524786625683566 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1540524786625683566><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Friday, August 21, 2026 8:55 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1540524786625683566>8/21/2026 8:55 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129419;"
    title="butterfly"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f98b.svg"> I-Cocoon Phakathi Kwezahluko <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127758;"
    title="earth_americas"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f30e.svg"> | I-Knocked Down. Yakha Kabusha. Ukuqhubekela Phambili. 12/08/2026</strong>

Ngezinye izikhathi isikhala phakathi kwalapho ubukhona nalapho uya khona asibonakali ngendlela obuyicabanga.

Njengamanje, esami sibukeka njenge-hammock. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128514;"
    title="joy"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f602.svg">

Futhi nakuba kungase kuzwakale kungavamile, kukhona into yokukhetha kulezi zimo. Ngezinye izikhathi ukugcina umngcele kusho ukuzimisela ukwamukela ukuphazamiseka okuhambisana nakho. Kimi, ukungakhululeki kwesikhashana kwakungcono kunokuhlala endaweni lapho ngangizwa sengathi imingcele yami iyaweqa.

Lokho akukhona ukusola noma ukubiza noma ubani. Kungukuqaphela nje ukuthi umngcele awusho lutho uma sikulungele ukuwugcina kuphela lapho ukwenza kanjalo kulula.

Ngithenge le hammock eJalimane esikhathini esingaphezu konyaka odlule ngaphambi kokuhamba kulo lonke elaseYurophu ngeveni—futhi ngandlela-thile angikaze ngiyisebenzise. Lapho ngishiya iJalimane, kukhona okwangitshela ukuthi ngiyilethe.

Manje, esikhathini sokuguquka, ngihlela isabelomali ngokucophelela futhi ngenza izivumelwano ezidingekayo ukuze ngifinyelele indawo yami elandelayo, leyo hammock ekhohliwe isibe yikhaya lesikhashana.

Futhi lapho ivala ngokuphelele nxazonke zami, ibukeka ngendlela exakile njenge-cocoon. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129419;"
    title="butterfly"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f98b.svg">

Njengoba kunikezwe konke lolu hambo olukumelele—ukugoba, ukwakha kabusha, ukuyeka, ukuguqulwa nokuqala kabusha—uphawu alulahleki kimi.

Ngezinye izikhathi i-cocoon ayiyona indawo uhambo oluma kuyo.

Yilapho inguqulo elandelayo iqala khona.

Phambili. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128591;"
    title="pray"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f64f.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127758;"
    title="earth_americas"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f30e.svg">

