Umbuso kanye neSonto — Igunya Lihoxisiwe. Izakhiwo Zichithiwe. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⛓️"
    title="chains"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/26d3.svg">‍<img
