    title="boom"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4a5.svg">

ISIMEMO NESIMEMO
Ngimemezela futhi nginquma ukuthi izimiso, imibandela, amagunya, noma izakhiwo ezihlonzwe njengezi:
(a) Umbuso
kanye
(b) neSonto
zichithwa, zichithwe, ziqedwe, futhi azisenawo amandla noma umphumela owengeziwe.
Ngakho-ke, (a) noma (b) ngeke bagcine noma yiliphi igunya, ukuma, isimangalo, ilungelo, isimo, noma umphumela ovela ekubeni khona kwabo kwangaphambilini, ngezinga eligcwele ngaphakathi kwegunya lami lokumemezela.
Lesi simemezelo senziwe ngamabomu, ngokucacile, nangaphandle kokungabaza.
Simenyezelwe futhi sanqunywa ngokufanele.

