    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128293;"
    title="fire"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f525.svg"> Ukufunda Okuhlangene <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg"> 02/04/2026 – Georgia</strong>

Lokhu kwakuzwakala sengathi kuhamba phakathi kwesiphithiphithi kuya ekucaceni.

Ngiqala kuleyo ndawo yokulwa nakho konke… ngizizwa sengathi nguwe vs umhlaba… ngithatha ama-hits, ngithwala isisindo — kuze kube yilapho ekugcineni kuyeka ukulimaza okufanayo. Njengokuthi, “izinkemba emhlane wami… kodwa manje seziyizinti zamazinyo.”

Bese kufika lokho kuphumula… ngibheke ngaphandle, ngibuza buthule: “Baphi abantu bami?”
Hhayi ngenxa yesizungu — ngenxa yokukhula ngaphandle kwalokho okungasafanele.

Kukhona ukushintshela eqinisweni ngemva kwalokho. Ukusebenza okuncane. Umzamo omncane.
“Ubunqunu… yebo… izingubo ziwumsebenzi omningi kakhulu.”
Ukwethembeka nje. Ukuba nje.

Futhi noma ngabe into yangempela inikezwa — into yangempela, egcwele, ehambisanayo — kusekhona lowo mzuzu wokungabaza… njengokuthi, “Angazi ukuthi ngenzeni ngalokhu.”

Endaweni ethile lapho kukhona ukuqaphela ukuthi akuzona zonke izimpi okwakudingeka zilwelwe… futhi akuzona zonke izimpi ezazifanele.

Kodwa noma kunjalo — ukunyakaza kuyabuya. Ukuqashelwa kuyalandela.

Futhi lowo mlilo ubuya ku-inthanethi.

Akuphoqelekile. Akuqinisekisiwe. Kumane… kungokwemvelo.

“Kufanele mhlawumbe wenze ucwaningo ngalokhu…”

Noma mhlawumbe usuvele wazi kahle ukuthi uyaphi.

Thatha lokho okuzwakalayo <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128293;"
    title="fire"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f525.svg">

