Imule ijaha inhliziyo elenga phambi kwayo ingafinyeleleki—ingaqapheli ukuthi umgwaqo ongaphansi kwezinyawo zayo uyisondo, nokuthi konke ukujikeleza kwayo kukhiqiza amandla.

Inhliziyo iwugibe.
Ukujaha kuyinkohliso.
Ukuphindaphinda kuyigeji.
Amandla yimali yokushintshisana. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚡"
    title="zap"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/26a1.svg">

Kuze kube yilapho imule iyeka.

Isondo lithula du.

USHINTSHO OLUNGALINDELEKILE ENDABENI: <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128680;"
    title="rotating_light"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f6a8.svg">

Imule yayingeyona imule neze.

Kwakuyimikhumbi-mkhathi. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128760;"
    title="flying_saucer"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f6f8.svg">

Kanti uhlelo lokuzulazula?

Uzwelo. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129728;"
    title="anatomical_heart"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1fac0.svg">

