<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1558067800801812552 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1558067800801812552><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Friday, October 9, 2026 6:45 AM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1558067800801812552>10/9/2026 6:45 AM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>Ukuzimela kwezezimali kuqala ngokuzigcinela nokulawula impahla yakho <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#129689;"
    title="coin"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1fa99.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128272;"
    title="closed_lock_with_key"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f510.svg"> 30/03/2025 - EThailand</strong>

Le vidiyo ayikhulumi ngentengo, inzuzo, noma ukubikezela okungaqinisekile (speculation).
Yaqoshwa ekuqaleni konyaka, kusetshenziswa i-Bitcoin njengesibonelo esicacile nesisebenzisekayo — ngoba yenza udaba lucace futhi lubonakale.

Kodwa umyalezo oyinhloko awumayelana ne-Bitcoin uqobo lwayo; umayelana nokuzimela kanye nokuba namandla okuzilawula.

I-Bitcoin iveza nje ukukhetha okutholakala kubo bonke abantu:
indlela eyodwa lapho ugcina khona okungokwakho,
nenye lapho omunye umuntu ekugcinela khona.

Iningi lokulahlekelwa, amahlazo, nokwesaba kuvela ekunikezeni abanye igunya lokugcina impahla yakho, ekudluliseleni umthwalo wemfanelo kwabanye, kanye nokwethemba abalamuli.

Ukuzimela kwezezimali kuqala lapho kuphela khona ukuncika kwabanye.

Ukuzigcinela impahla yakho akuyona nje iseluleko — kuwumgomo.
Kumayelana nokuqonda, umthwalo wemfanelo, kanye nobunikazi, kunoma yiluphi uhlelo.

Lokhu akukhulumi ngokuzama ukubikezela izikhathi ezifanele zokuhweba emakethe.
Kumayelana nokugcina amandla okuzilawula.

Akusona iseluleko sezimali. Kuwukucabanga nje ngokuzimela, umthwalo wemfanelo, kanye nokukhetha.

